.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH fork 1  "fork " 
.SH NAME
fork \- Fork someone\*(Aqs snippet into your account (server\-side)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBfork\fR [\fB\-\-as\fR] [\fB\-\-registry\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIREFERENCE\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Fork someone\*(Aqs snippet into your account (server\-side)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-as\fR \fI<AS_NAME>\fR
Name for the fork (default: the source name)
.TP
\fB\-\-registry\fR \fI<REGISTRY>\fR
Registry base URL (default: `FORGEHUB_REGISTRY` or config)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIREFERENCE\fR>
`owner/name` of the snippet to fork
.SH EXTRA
Examples:
  fg fork alice/deploy \-\-as my\-deploy
